        "content": "<p>alexcrichton opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/15267\">issue #15267</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>With the custom-page-sizes proposal enabled, <code>WasmCoreDump::serialize</code> writes a core dump that doesn't match the guest's memories:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"WebAssembly\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">module</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">memory</span> <span class=\"nv\">$small</span> <span class=\"mf\">5001</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">pagesize</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">memory</span> <span class=\"nv\">$tiny</span> <span class=\"mf\">100</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">pagesize</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">data</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">memory</span> <span class=\"nv\">$small</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nb\">i32.const</span> <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"head\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">data</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">memory</span> <span class=\"nv\">$small</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nb\">i32.const</span> <span class=\"mf\">4090</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"across-the-boundary\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">data</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">memory</span> <span class=\"nv\">$small</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nb\">i32.const</span> <span class=\"mf\">4990</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"tail-bytes\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">data</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">memory</span> <span class=\"nv\">$tiny</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nb\">i32.const</span> <span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"tiny-data\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">func</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">export</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"trap\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"nb\">unreachable</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Rust\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"cp\">$</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">wasmtime</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">W</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">custom</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">page</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">sizes</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">D</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">coredump</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">out</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">--</span><span class=\"n\">invoke</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">trap</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">cps</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wat</span>\n<span class=\"cp\">$</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">tools</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">print</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">out</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">core</span>\n<span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">module</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">..</span><span class=\"p\">.</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">memory</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(;</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">;)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">5001</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">memory</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(;</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">;)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">100</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(;</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">;)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kt\">i32</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"k\">const</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"head</span><span class=\"se\">\\0</span><span class=\"s\">0</span><span class=\"se\">\\0</span><span class=\"s\">0...</span><span class=\"se\">\\0</span><span class=\"s\">0across\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">..</span><span class=\"p\">.</span>\n<span class=\"p\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>There are two problems here:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Both memories have the wrong page size.</li>\n<li>Data past the last full 4096-byte chunk is missing.</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>",
